    <Label Name="Title" Style="GalleryTitle" Text="Moon Jelly" Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="16" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
    <Label Name="Description" Style="GalleryText" Text="Drag the pearl around its ring, and the jellyfish swims. Waves run down its tentacles (drag backward, and they run up): each dot swings like the one above it, a moment later.\n\nThe bell is one smooth curve through 18 dots. As it squeezes, the curve pulls tighter and the holes in its rings shrink. Check &quot;Dots,&quot; click a dot, then drag the pearl: its two pink handles, which steer the curve, turn by themselves." Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="64" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
